OL,3,GNEWSASecond body found after building
OL,4,Afire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second body has been discovered
OL,7,Ffollowing a building fire in a market
OL,8,Ftown, police said.
OL,10,FThe body was found earlier in the
OL,11,Frubble of a property on the corner of
OL,12,FWarwick Road and Mount Street in Batley
OL,13,Fafter a large blaze in the early hours
OL,14,Fof 15 August.
OL,16,FWest Yorkshire Police recovered a
OL,17,Fdifferent body on Wednesday and the
OL,18,Fcause of the fire remains under
OL,19,Finvestigation, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
