OL,3,GNEWSASecond body found after building
OL,4,Afire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police spokesperson said: "I can
OL,7,Fconfirm additional human remains have
OL,8,Fbeen found at the location today and
OL,9,Fwork remains ongoing to identify the
OL,10,Fperson sadly found deceased at the
OL,11,Fscene on Wednesday."
